            "subject_id": "ONX_BCO1_SMOOTH_STRONG_PROPER__instance",
            "description": "The public domain belongs to $\\mathcal K_d=\\{K:(4d)^{-1}B_2^d\\subseteq K\\subseteq B_2^d,\\ K\\text{ compact and convex}\\}$. Every loss is the restriction of a continuously differentiable function on a neighborhood of $K$, takes values in $[0,1]$ on $K$, is $\\mu$-strongly convex, and is $\\beta$-smooth in the Euclidean norm on $K$. No globally bounded strongly convex extension is assumed.",
            "scope": "The domain stated in this clause."
          },
