            "subject_id": "ONX_BCO1_SMOOTH_STRONG_PROPER__instance",
            "description": "An oblivious adversary fixes the loss sequence before the learner seed is drawn. The domain is known, the losses are hidden, and $0<\\mu\\le\\beta$. Only domains with a nonempty loss class are included. The family is nonempty exactly when $\\mu\\le32d^2$.",
            "scope": "The domain stated in this clause."
